NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Form comes with a ready-to-go suite of devtools."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"setup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Setup"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the "},{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest/docs/quick-start","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools"}]},{"type":"text","value":" library and the "},{"type":"link","href":"http://npmjs.com/package/@tanstack/react-form-devtools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Form plugin"}]},{"type":"text","value":", from the framework adapter that you're working in (in this case "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/react-devtools"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/react-form-devtools"},{"type":"text","value":")."}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm i @tanstack/react-devtools\nnpm i @tanstack/react-form-devtools","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next, in the root of your application, import the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Import the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"formDevtoolsPlugin"},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Form"}]},{"type":"text","value":" and provide it to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" component."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\nimport { formDevtoolsPlugin } from '@tanstack/react-form-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools plugins={[formDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Finally, add any additional configuration you desire to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" component. More information can be found under the "},{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/devtools/","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools Configuration"}]},{"type":"text","value":" section."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A complete working example can be found in our "},{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/form/latest/docs/framework/react/examples/devtools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"examples section"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"setup","text":"Setup","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack Form comes with a ready-to-go suite of devtools.\n\n## Setup\n\nInstall the [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest/docs/quick-start) library and the [TanStack Form plugin](http://npmjs.com/package/@tanstack/react-form-devtools), from the framework adapter that you're working in (in this case `@tanstack/react-devtools` and `@tanstack/react-form-devtools`).\n\n```bash\nnpm i @tanstack/react-devtools\nnpm i @tanstack/react-form-devtools\n```\n\nNext, in the root of your application, import the `TanStackDevtools`.\n\n```tsx\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nImport the `formDevtoolsPlugin` from **TanStack Form** and provide it to the `TanStackDevtools` component.\n\n```tsx\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\nimport { formDevtoolsPlugin } from '@tanstack/react-form-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools plugins={[formDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nFinally, add any additional configuration you desire to the `TanStackDevtools` component. More information can be found under the [TanStack Devtools Configuration](https://tanstack.com/devtools/) section.\n\nA complete working example can be found in our [examples section](https://tanstack.com/form/latest/docs/framework/react/examples/devtools).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: devtools\ntitle: Devtools\n---\n\nTanStack Form comes with a ready-to-go suite of devtools.\n\n## Setup\n\nInstall the [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest/docs/quick-start) library and the [TanStack Form plugin](http://npmjs.com/package/@tanstack/react-form-devtools), from the framework adapter that you're working in (in this case `@tanstack/react-devtools` and `@tanstack/react-form-devtools`).\n\n```bash\nnpm i @tanstack/react-devtools\nnpm i @tanstack/react-form-devtools\n```\n\nNext, in the root of your application, import the `TanStackDevtools`.\n\n```tsx\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nImport the `formDevtoolsPlugin` from **TanStack Form** and provide it to the `TanStackDevtools` component.\n\n```tsx\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\nimport { formDevtoolsPlugin } from '@tanstack/react-form-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools plugins={[formDevtoolsPlugin()]} />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nFinally, add any additional configuration you desire to the `TanStackDevtools` component. More information can be found under the [TanStack Devtools Configuration](https://tanstack.com/devtools/) section.\n\nA complete working example can be found in our [examples section](https://tanstack.com/form/latest/docs/framework/react/examples/devtools).\n"}
